Subject: [PATCH] SCH-103: Expose queue ranking on the selected snapshot
 executor

Keep the pgx entry compatible and share the same snapshot validation, scope and ranking implementation. Reject pooled, wrong-engine and wrong-mode inputs. The caller establishes REPEATABLE READ as its first selected-store statement and retains commit ownership; final admission still rechecks current state.

Research PostgreSQL 18 transaction setup and snapshot semantics. Add pending selected-store snapshot, mode and scope tests; verify gofmt and diff hygiene. Native qualification of this additive entry remains pending.
